 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 遭遇了一次大规模盗窃。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 遭遇了一次大规模盗窃。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 1.699,
   "speechEnd": 6.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "被盗资金，经过主要的清扫交易，转了出去。",
   "spoken": "被盗资金，经过主要的清扫交易，转了出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 6.54,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 6.636,
   "speechEnd": 10.127
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "37 分钟后，Tether 冻结了 9.711 亿 USDT。",
   "spoken": "37 分钟后，Tether 冻结了 9.711 亿 USDT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 10.6,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 10.6,
   "speechEnd": 15.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "又过了 3 分钟，Circle 冻结了 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "spoken": "又过了 3 分钟，Circle 冻结了 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 16.34,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 16.432,
   "speechEnd": 21.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "听起来很快，可还是慢了一步。",
   "spoken": "听起来很快，可还是慢了一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 21.52,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 21.52,
   "speechEnd": 24.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "Elliptic 估计，冻结生效之前，约 7.86 亿美元的稳定币，已经被换成了 ETH 和 TRX。",
   "spoken": "Elliptic 估计，冻结生效之前，约 7.86 亿美元的稳定币，已经被换成了 ETH 和 TRX。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.78,
   "dur": 9.36,
   "speechStart": 24.873,
   "speechEnd": 33.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "换成这两种币，发行方就管不到了。",
   "spoken": "换成这两种币，发行方就管不到了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 34.36,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 34.36,
   "speechEnd": 37.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "TRM 统计，事发后约 4 小时，各方累计冻结约 27 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "TRM 统计，事发后约 4 小时，各方垒计冻结约 27 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 37.62,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 37.62,
   "speechEnd": 42.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "就算这样，冻结也只覆盖了约 44% 的损失。",
   "spoken": "就算这样，冻结也只覆盖了约 44% 的损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 43.28,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 43.28,
   "speechEnd": 47.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 47.5,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 47.5,
   "speechEnd": 48.301
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "被盗的资产里，有 USDT 和 USDC，也有 BTC、XRP 和 SOL。",
   "spoken": "被盗的资产里，有 USDT 和 USDC，也有 BTC、XRP 和 SOL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 48.76,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 48.857,
   "speechEnd": 56.606
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "发行方冻结，能管到其中哪几种？",
   "spoken": "发行方冻结，能管到其中哪几种？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 56.98,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 56.98,
   "speechEnd": 60.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看，钱被转走之后，到底能拦住多少。",
   "spoken": "带着这个问题，我们看看，钱被转走之后，到底能拦住多少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 61.16,
